[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20281.75, "timestamp": "05:38:01", "text": "。去動畫組。  點這裡。我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20290.11, "timestamp": "05:38:10", "text": "有淡入淡出、飛入飛出、擦入擦出、乘客進出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20293.91, "timestamp": "05:38:13", "text": "呃，把關閉的元素移到可以淡入的位置。哦。哦，這個努力很好。看，看，看。褪色了。正面朝外。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20313.628, "timestamp": "05:38:33", "text": "向下捲動頁面就能看到它了。  這一點也適用於任何事物。啊，那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20328.99, "timestamp": "05:38:48", "text": "它仍然會逐漸消失"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20336.456, "timestamp": "05:38:56", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Hiiieeee JOQ!UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2AkUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2Ak"}]